"秋，卫将军姜维出攻雍州，不克而还；将军句安、李韶降魏。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"huanchen-q-28b49327f5ad439710e1","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-254a172769bdb7654813","layer":"original","quote":"淮从泰计，使泰率讨蜀护军徐质、南安太守邓艾等进兵围之〖15〗，断其运道及城外流水。安等挑战，不许；将士困窘，分粮聚雪以稽日月","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62},{"id":"huanchen-q-2d704ad9a4abe37c0e91","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-4bec50eee4e3872f6306","layer":"original","quote":"蜀（大）〔卫〕将军姜维率众依麹山筑二城〖11〗，使牙门将句安、李歆等守之〖12〗；聚羌胡质任等寇逼诸郡","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":80},{"id":"huanchen-q-37a9a72e93079c725c4c","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-4ded89eb20a03c8b313b","layer":"original","quote":"淮善其策，进率诸军军洮水〖19〗。维惧，遁走；安等孤悬，遂皆降","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31},{"id":"mantian-q-1fad7cad262d534f9e31","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-b3a9d9dc77437b1997ce","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，与雍州刺史陈泰协策〖33〗，降蜀牙门将句安等于翅上","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":48},{"id":"mantian-q-fae704f7e85e5384bcc0","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-b3a9d9dc77437b1997ce","layer":"original","quote":"降蜀牙门将句安等于翅上〖34〗","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":37,"end":52}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
